<p>Hi {{{Case.Contact_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>Thank you for submitting your Christmas Assistance application with Help Give Hope.</p>

<p>Your application has been received successfully. To confirm that this email address is correct, please click the button below:</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
	
		<tr>
			<td align="center" bgcolor="#006d69" style="border-radius: 6px;"><a href="{{{Case.Email_Verification_Link__c}}}" style="display: inline-block;
                    padding: 12px 22px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    text-decoration: none;
                    border-radius: 6px;
                    background-color: #006d69;">Verify Email Address </a></td>
		</tr>
	
</table>

<p>If the button above does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>

<p>{{{Case.Email_Verification_Link__c}}}</p>

<p>Our team will review the information provided and will reach out if any further details are needed.</p>

<p>We are honored to support families during the Christmas season and truly appreciate your time in completing the application.</p>

<p>Thank you again, and we wish you and your family peace and blessings this season.</p>

<p>Warm regards,<br />
Help Give Hope</p>
